<p>Pope Leo XIV accepted the resignation of Bishop Mark E. Brennan, 79, from the Diocese of Wheeling-Charleston and appointed Bishop Evelio Menjivar-Ayala as his successor in West Virginia, the U.S. Conference of Catholic Bishops said May 1. Menjivar-Ayala is a Salvadoran-born auxiliary bishop in Washington. The appointment drew attention because Menjivar-Ayala has spoken publicly about arriving in the United States without legal status and because he has criticized President Trump&#x27;s immigration crackdown. Pope Leo and Trump have publicly clashed over migration and foreign policy.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Tip6ZT1VjmeVVtE_18c9SqITm-5JPHBe4utRaMwIdPHpyvMaWK0ru4gkjaGk5o95azZ1m2zssxrVy0COTQmJ51rGQ2IjFqNwVlrryBOF9ITqbZ1mpcKg1ukIzJ-cO5mGM9rYlJDbf4ZCYAFdLTG0FeC0DWaZ6lFcFzvYtqQ2VyyHSgJ5yZEP-JEg8YypOTbCoH7QgkEzI0lcHNZkGSl83pgSe2u6QRP3_ZKBa55UnoG4-IeZnLsyWY1U7s_l2BqDr4Qe' alt='The Vatican named Evelio Menjivar-Ayala to lead the Diocese of Wheeling-Charleston in West Virginia.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Diocese scope: The Diocese of Wheeling-Charleston covers 24,041 square miles across West Virginia, according to the U.S. Conference of Catholic Bishops.</li><li>Migration route: Menjivar-Ayala has said he was detained in Mexico, paid a bribe to get out and crossed the border at Tijuana; Infobae reported he ultimately entered hidden in a car trunk.</li><li>Salvadoran milestone: Infobae, citing The Washington Post, described Menjivar-Ayala as the first U.S. bishop born in El Salvador.</li><li>Other appointments: The Vatican announced new bishops for several U.S. dioceses at the same time, including John Gomez for Laredo, Texas.</li></ul><blockquote>We have to look for ways of treating people humanely - Pope Leo XIV</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Vatican and USCCB: Cardinal Christophe Pierre, the apostolic nuncio to the United States, announced the changes in Washington, D.C., and the bishops&#x27; conference directed readers to Menjivar-Ayala&#x27;s biography. (<a href='https://www.usccb.org/news/2026/pope-leo-xiv-accepts-resignation-bishop-mark-brennan-wheeling-charleston-appoints-bishop'>U.S. Conference of Catholic Bishops</a>)</li><li>Pope Leo XIV: Iraqi News separately reported that Leo called President Trump&#x27;s threat to destroy Iran &quot;unacceptable.&quot; (<a href='https://www.iraqinews.com/world/pope-names-former-undocumented-migrant-as-us-bishop/'>Iraqi News</a>)</li><li>President Trump: Iraqi News reported that Trump responded to Leo&#x27;s Iran remarks by calling the pontiff &quot;WEAK on Crime, and terrible for Foreign Policy.&quot; (<a href='https://www.iraqinews.com/world/pope-names-former-undocumented-migrant-as-us-bishop/'>Iraqi News</a>)</li><li>Evelio Menjivar-Ayala: Menjivar-Ayala has described his migration as a refugee journey marked by poverty, armed conflict and obstacles before the start of his U.S. church career. (<a href='https://www.nacion.com/el-mundo/papa-leon-xiv-designa-a-exmigrante-indocumentado/OCWTY3K45FDIHJ3Z56HM45KHOE/story/'>La Nación</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/pope-names-former-undocumented-migrant-as-us-bishop'>Pope names former undocumented migrant as US bishop of West Virginia</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/nation/pope-leo-names-priest-who-criticized-trumps-immigration-crackdown-as-west-virginia-bishop'>Pope Leo names priest who criticized Trump&#x27;s immigration crackdown as West Virginia bishop</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/pope-leo-names-former-undocumented-migrant-as-us-bishop-11437468#publisher=newsstand'>Pope Leo Names Former Undocumented Migrant As US Bishop</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/may/01/pope-former-undocumented-immigrant-bishop-west-virginia'>Pope appoints former undocumented immigrant as bishop of West Virginia</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ira